    "Name": "Minsk",
    "Details": "A modified Minsk 101, the 102 is not a true upgrade. Instead Ghost Bear engineers opted to remove the Star League era Active Probe in favour of a modern model. With the freed weight, the engineers installed an additional 2 Machine Guns. Produced with Minsk 101's pulled out of a Brian Cache, the Bears would use the design as a bodyguard unit for PGC units; freeing up more resources for Operation Revival.\n\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Protected Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
